  "Batman":"Scott Snyder and Greg Capullo's defining New 52 Batman saga follows Bruce Wayne through the Court of Owls, the Joker's return, Zero Year, Endgame and the closing chapters of the pre-Rebirth era.",
  "Detective Comics":"The detective side of Gotham's New 52 era, moving from Tony S. Daniel's opening mystery-driven stories through Penguin, Anarky and Gordon's wartime Gotham.",
  "Batman and Robin":"Peter J. Tomasi and Patrick Gleason's Batman-and-son story tracks Bruce and Damian Wayne through their partnership, fracture, grief and the return of Robin.",
  "Batman: The Dark Knight":"A darker New 52 companion title exploring Batman's encounters with Gotham's most dangerous threats, from Scarecrow and Bane to Clayface and the final run.",
  "Batman Incorporated":"Grant Morrison's international Batman operation continues with Bruce Wayne expanding the mission beyond Gotham while facing Leviathan and the consequences of his global war.",
  "Batman Eternal":"A year-long weekly Batman mystery pulls Gotham's allies into a city-wide conspiracy involving old enemies, hidden players and a threat reaching deep into Gotham's institutions.",
  "Batman and Robin Eternal":"A weekly Bat-family mystery jumps between the present and Bruce Wayne's early career, uncovering a buried case that connects Batman, his partners and Cassandra Cain.",
  "Batman: Europa":"A globe-spanning Batman thriller sends Bruce Wayne across Europe while a deadly infection forces him to solve the mystery before time runs out.",
  "Batgirl":"Barbara Gordon's New 52 journey moves from the early Simone era into Burnside, following her changing identity, friendships and role in Gotham.",
  "Nightwing":"Dick Grayson returns to the role of Nightwing, balancing Gotham, the Bat-family and the fallout of larger DC events before his identity takes a new direction.",
  "Grayson":"After leaving the Nightwing identity, Dick Grayson becomes a covert operative for Spyral, turning the former Gotham hero into a globe-trotting spy.",
  "Red Hood and the Outlaws":"Jason Todd leads a volatile team with Starfire and Arsenal through missions that mix outlaw justice, family baggage and escalating threats across the DC Universe.",
  "Red Hood / Arsenal":"Jason Todd and Roy Harper reunite as partners, carrying their outlaw approach into a fast-moving New 52/late-era team-up.",
  "Robin: Son of Batman":"Damian Wayne steps into a lead role, confronting the consequences of his childhood training and the legacy of the League of Assassins.",
  "We Are Robin":"A movement of young Gotham vigilantes adopts the Robin symbol, creating a street-level network that operates outside Batman's traditional command structure.",
  "Batwoman":"Kate Kane's New 52 series blends superhero action with military, supernatural and personal conflicts as Batwoman builds her own place within Gotham's wider world.",
  "Catwoman":"Selina Kyle's New 52 solo series follows her evolution from thief and antihero to a major criminal power in Gotham, culminating in her complicated new position after Batman Eternal.",
  "Batwing":"David Zavimbe's Batwing brings Batman's mission to Africa before the title shifts to Luke Fox, expanding the Bat-family beyond Gotham.",
  "Birds of Prey":"A rotating team of Gotham and DC heroines takes on missions involving organized crime, super-powered threats and the darker corners of the New 52.",
  "Talon":"Calvin Rose, a former Court of Owls assassin, fights against the organization that trained him while uncovering the deeper history of Gotham's Talons.",
  "Bat-Mite":"Bat-Mite interferes in Batman's life with the confidence of a self-appointed super-fan, turning the New 52 Batman world into a deliberately comedic adventure.",
  "Batman Beyond":"Terry McGinnis carries the Batman legacy into a futuristic Gotham while Bruce Wayne and the wider Bat-family remain part of the story's foundation.",
  "Arkham Manor":"When Arkham Asylum becomes unusable, Gotham's most dangerous inmates are relocated to Wayne Manor, forcing Batman to deal with a bizarre new security nightmare.",
  "Gotham Academy":"Olive Silverlock and her classmates uncover the secrets, ghosts and hidden history surrounding Gotham Academy in a coming-of-age mystery rooted in Gotham lore.",
  "Gotham by Midnight":"A supernatural task force investigates occult threats in Gotham, taking the Batman-line into horror territory where conventional crime-fighting rules do not apply.",
  "Batman/Superman":"Batman and Superman navigate the early New 52 version of their partnership through alternate worlds, conspiracies and threats that demand the combined strengths of both heroes."
